; ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
; SUB-LEVEL ZERO — THE PICKLE GAUNTLET (expanded)
;
; Top-down (-Z is north on the world axis; +X is east). Player spawns south in
; the operating theater and can branch four ways from the cross hub. The east
; arm holds switch 1 (Power Closet), the north spine through Containment Bay
; holds switch 2 then switch 3 (Observation Hall), and the west arm hits the
; boss arena. Boss arena east door = 3-switch unlock; west door = boss-kill
; unlock. Three new wings hang off this spine:
;
;   • South wing — Operating Theater south door → South Atrium hub →
;     Annex E / Annex W loot rooms, plus the Pillar Pit (jump puzzle) and
;     the Reactor Heart bonus room behind it.
;   • East end — Generator Room east door → Server Bay loot dead-end.
;   • North end — Observation Hall north door → Records Vault loot dead-end.
;
; Wall enum: NORTH=0, SOUTH=1, EAST=2, WEST=3
;
;                                          [Records Vault]   <- new north end
;                                              (0, -75)
;                                                 │
;                                          [Records Corr]
;                                              (0, -70)
;                                                 │
;                              [Archive]──[Obs Hall 10x10]               <- switch 3
;                                                (0, -63)
;                                                 │
;                                         [Sensor Corr (pit)]
;                                              (0, -52)
;                                                 │
;                       [Spec W]──[Containment 14x14]──[Spec E]          <- switch 2
;                                              (0, -39)
;                                                 │
;                                          [Crouch Corr]
;                                              (0, -28)
;                                                 │
; [Stair]──[Boss Exit]──[Boss Arena]──[Approach B]──[Boss Junction]──[Approach A]──[Cross Hub]──[East A]──[East Jct]──[East B]──[Power]──[Gen Corr]──[Gen Room]──[East Term]──[Server Bay]
;  (-41)                  (-25)                       (-10)                          (0,-20)              (13,-20)             (23,-20)              (33,-20)              (42,-20)
;                                                       │                              │                                        ↑
;                                                  [Holding]                    [Spawn Corr]                                  switch 1
;                                                  (-10,-28)                          │
;                                                                              [Op Theater]
;                                                                                 (0,-4)
;                                                                                  ←spawn
;                                                                              [South Spawn]
;                                                                                 (0,2)
;                                                                                    │
;                                                  [Annex W]── [South Atrium] ──[Annex E]   <- new south wing
;                                                  (-12,7)        (0,7)        (12,7)
;                                                                    │
;                                                              [Pit Corr]
;                                                                  (0,11)
;                                                                    │
;                                                          [Pillar Pit 8x14]   <- jump puzzle
;                                                                 (0,19)
;                                                                    │
;                                                            [Reactor Corr]
;                                                                 (0,27)
;                                                                    │
;                                                          [Reactor Heart 10x10]
;                                                                 (0,33)
; ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

; ── 1. Operating Theater — player wakes here, doors N/E/S ─────────────────
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="room_op"]
